@startuml
title 設計差分図: master-persona componentization - component view

top to bottom direction
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor<<existing>> #F7F9FC
    BorderColor<<existing>> #546E7A
    FontColor<<existing>> #243447
    BackgroundColor<<added>> #EEF9EF
    BorderColor<<added>> #2E7D32
    FontColor<<added>> #1B5E20
    BackgroundColor<<removed>> #FFF1F1
    BorderColor<<removed>> #C62828
    FontColor<<removed>> #7F1D1D
    BackgroundColor<<changed>> #FFF8E1
    BorderColor<<changed>> #F9A825
    FontColor<<changed>> #4E342E
    BackgroundColor<<risk>> #F4F7FA
    BorderColor<<risk>> #607D8B
    FontColor<<risk>> #1F2933
}

legend bottom right
    |= Style |= Meaning |
    |<#F7F9FC> existing | 変更しない接続先または既存再利用 |
    |<#EEF9EF> added | この task で追加する部品または経路 |
    |<#FFF1F1> removed | page から減らす責務または禁止経路 |
    |<#FFF8E1> changed | 責務を薄くする既存要素 |
    |<#F4F7FA> risk | 人間レビューで確認したい境界 |
endlegend

package "production screen path" {
  class "MasterPersonaPage\n<<changed>>\ncontroller mount\nsubscribe\nfile input bridge\nstatus / notice\nprops composition only" as Page <<changed>>
  class "CreateMasterPersonaScreenController\n<<existing>>" as Factory <<existing>>
  class "MasterPersonaScreenControllerContract\n<<existing>>" as Controller <<existing>>

  class "GenerationSetupPanel\n<<changed>>\nsmall props + callbacks" as Setup <<changed>>
  class "RunStatusPanel\n<<changed>>\nsmall props + callbacks" as Run <<changed>>
  class "PersonaReviewPanel\n<<changed>>\nsmall props + callbacks" as Review <<changed>>
  class "PersonaActionModal\n<<changed>>\nsmall props + callbacks" as Modal <<changed>>

  class "AIModelSelectionCard\n<<existing>>\nshared component reuse" as AIModelCard <<existing>>

  class "whole viewModel props\n<<removed>>\nscreen local component receives\nMasterPersonaScreenViewModel directly" as WholeViewModel <<removed>>
  class "page-owned display detail\n<<removed>>\nAI card fallback build\npreview text build\nlist / detail display rules" as PageDetail <<removed>>

  class "screen-local props types\n<<added>>\nGenerationSetupPanelProps\nRunStatusPanelProps\nPersonaReviewPanelProps\nPersonaActionModalProps" as PropsBoundary <<added>>
}

package "storybook path" {
  class "GenerationSetupPanel.stories\nRunStatusPanel.stories\nPersonaReviewPanel.stories\nPersonaActionModal.stories\n<<added>>" as Stories <<added>>
  class "master-persona __fixtures__\nsynthetic props only\n<<added>>" as Fixtures <<added>>
}

package "unchanged external boundary" {
  class "Wails runtime\n<<existing>>" as Runtime <<existing>>
  class "Gateway\n<<existing>>" as Gateway <<existing>>
  class "RuntimeEventAdapter\n<<existing>>" as EventAdapter <<existing>>
  class "AI provider / secret store / DB\nbackend DTO / generated wailsjs\n<<existing>>" as External <<existing>>
}

class "forbidden Storybook route\n<<removed>>\nexternal connection\nsecret\nreal user data" as ForbiddenRoute <<removed>>
class "review note\n<<risk>>\npage story is optional\npanel and modal stories are required" as ReviewNote <<risk>>

Factory -[#546E7A]-> Controller
Page -[#546E7A]-> Factory : create on mount
Page -[#F9A825]-> Setup : compose props
Page -[#F9A825]-> Run : compose props
Page -[#F9A825]-> Review : compose props
Page -[#F9A825]-> Modal : compose props
Setup -[#546E7A]-> AIModelCard : reuse

WholeViewModel -[#C62828,dashed]-> Setup
WholeViewModel -[#C62828,dashed]-> Run
WholeViewModel -[#C62828,dashed]-> Review
WholeViewModel -[#C62828,dashed]-> Modal
PageDetail -[#C62828,dashed]-> Page

PropsBoundary -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> Page : derive per panel
PropsBoundary -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> Setup
PropsBoundary -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> Run
PropsBoundary -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> Review
PropsBoundary -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> Modal

Stories -[#2E7D32]-> Setup
Stories -[#2E7D32]-> Run
Stories -[#2E7D32]-> Review
Stories -[#2E7D32]-> Modal
Stories -[#2E7D32]-> Fixtures : import fixed props
Fixtures -[#2E7D32,dashed]-> PropsBoundary : share fixture boundary

Controller -[#546E7A]-> Runtime
Controller -[#546E7A]-> Gateway
Controller -[#546E7A]-> EventAdapter
Gateway -[#546E7A]-> External

ForbiddenRoute -[#C62828,dashed]-> Stories
ForbiddenRoute -[#C62828,dashed]-> Fixtures
ReviewNote -[#607D8B,dotted]-> Stories
ReviewNote -[#607D8B,dotted]-> Page

note right of Page
変更理由:
- page を controller 接続と表示合成へ薄くする
- file input bridge と notice / status は page に残す
end note

note bottom of Setup
追加予定:
- AIModelSelectionCard へ渡す props を panel 側で閉じる
- Storybook で未選択 / preview 成功 / 設定不足 / 更新中を確認する
end note

note bottom of Review
追加予定:
- 一覧, 詳細, 空状態, page 操作を story で確認する
- edit / delete 開始は callback 境界へ寄せる
end note

@enduml

@startuml
title 設計差分図: master-persona componentization - sequence view

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "利用者" as User
participant "MasterPersonaPage\n<<changed>>" as SeqPage
participant "Controller\n<<existing>>" as SeqController
participant "GenerationSetupPanel\n<<changed>>" as SeqSetup
participant "RunStatusPanel\n<<changed>>" as SeqRun
participant "PersonaReviewPanel\n<<changed>>" as SeqReview
participant "PersonaActionModal\n<<changed>>" as SeqModal
participant "AIModelSelectionCard\n<<existing>>" as SeqCard
participant "Storybook story\n<<added>>" as SeqStory
participant "__fixtures__\n<<added>>" as SeqFixture
participant "external runtime / secret / DB\n<<existing>>" as SeqExternal

== production render after componentization ==
User -> SeqPage : 画面を開く
SeqPage -> SeqController : createController()\nmount()\nsubscribe()
SeqController --> SeqPage : viewModel updates
SeqPage -> SeqPage : notice / status / file input bridge を保持
SeqPage -> SeqPage : panel ごとの small props を作る
SeqPage -> SeqSetup : GenerationSetupPanelProps + callbacks
SeqSetup -> SeqCard : AIModelSelectionCard props + callbacks
SeqPage -> SeqRun : RunStatusPanelProps + callbacks
SeqPage -> SeqReview : PersonaReviewPanelProps + callbacks
SeqPage -> SeqModal : PersonaActionModalProps + callbacks

note right of SeqPage
[削除予定]
child へ whole viewModel を直接渡さない
page で表示詳細を抱え続けない
end note

User -> SeqSetup : JSON 選択 / AI 設定 / 作成開始
SeqSetup --> SeqPage : callback
SeqPage -> SeqController : stageJsonSelection()\nsetAIProvider()\nsetAIModel()\nexecuteGeneration()
SeqController -> SeqExternal : existing production path
SeqExternal --> SeqController : existing response
SeqController --> SeqPage : updated viewModel
SeqPage -> SeqRun : progress props refresh
SeqPage -> SeqReview : list / detail props refresh
SeqPage -> SeqModal : modal props refresh

== Storybook isolated render ==
SeqStory -> SeqFixture : import synthetic props
SeqFixture --> SeqStory : fixed props + callback stub
SeqStory -> SeqSetup : props only
SeqStory -> SeqRun : props only
SeqStory -> SeqReview : props only
SeqStory -> SeqModal : props only
SeqSetup -> SeqCard : shared card props only

note right of SeqStory
[追加予定]
panel / modal ごとに story を持つ
page story は任意
end note

note right of SeqFixture
[禁止]
Wails runtime
Gateway
RuntimeEventAdapter
AI provider
secret
real user data
end note

@enduml
